laya-lab
========

The MIT licence in LICENSE covers the original contents of this repository:
the scenarios in scenarios/, the utilities in tools/, the Makefile and the
README.

It does NOT cover Laya itself. Laya is a separate project by Convai
Innovations, licensed Apache-2.0:

    https://github.com/NandhaKishorM/laya

Laya's source is not vendored here. `make upstream` clones it into ./upstream/
at the commit recorded in UPSTREAM_PIN, and that directory is git-ignored, so
no Apache-2.0 code is redistributed by this repository.

scenarios/06_silent_footguns.py quotes one line of Laya's common.py inline, with
a file:line citation, in order to explain the behaviour it demonstrates.
